{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Apply type-strict equality recursively**\n\nThe boolean guard applies only when the compared value itself is a boolean. For container assertions, Python equality still treats `{\"value\": 1}` and `{\"value\": true}` as equal, allowing type-invalid nested input/output telemetry to pass. Implement recursive mapping/sequence comparison that applies the boolean rule at every leaf and add nested regression tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABArneYQ","finding_digest":"f0d1fd19c910cea8a90dd5d835a5b30f527abd7fd77dac14b11260b2cb643e9b","finding_id":"arf_v1_6di72gojcdhkrkin2xmdljntb5","finding_key":"telemetry/validators.py::_equal::nested-boolean-type-equivalence","identity_key":"telemetry/validators.py::_equal::nested-boolean-type-equivalence","line":143,"observation_digest":"1bed9e72f7848f689cc9bfddd15146643af7bb89eb51ef58179b69e152eaacda","observation_id":"aro_v1_dpwz44xxqshwrhgjx7o5cukgmq","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests-telemetry/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests_telemetry/validators.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-21T18:53:24Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fm7oviql6wego5jpcnduindzqh","reviewed_base_sha":"37656dd6f43d565d8e90e22f3554faa7c92dcb01","reviewed_head_sha":"765d19140bc5a0ca60870695fcd82c9fb22cfba5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":138,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":144},"record_id":"art_v1_6tgzl25g6j54wgg4m43f5lxptk","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-21T18:53:24Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
